WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.575
This is JARVIS — a voice assistant with artificial intelligence that lives on your computer.

2
00:00:07.575 --> 00:00:08.827
Not in the cloud.

3
00:00:08.827 --> 00:00:10.079
Not in a browser.

4
00:00:10.079 --> 00:00:10.962
Right here.

5
00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:13.921
You speak or type.

6
00:00:13.921 --> 00:00:15.800
In Ukrainian or English.

7
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:20.261
It listens, understands and answers with a natural voice.

8
00:00:20.261 --> 00:00:22.687
And remembers the conversation.

9
00:00:23.987 --> 00:00:26.400
Under the hood is smart failover.

10
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:32.394
Dozens of models and eight providers: Gemini, Groq, DeepSeek, OpenRouter and more.

11
00:00:32.394 --> 00:00:36.927
One key fails — JARVIS switches to the next one automatically.

12
00:00:38.227 --> 00:00:41.835
But the main thing is that it doesn't just answer.

13
00:00:41.835 --> 00:00:47.535
It launches apps by name, works with files, controls windows, volume and media.

14
00:00:47.535 --> 00:00:50.927
Dangerous actions only after your confirmation.

15
00:00:52.227 --> 00:00:55.147
For Roblox developers there's special magic.

16
00:00:55.147 --> 00:01:04.770
Through the official Studio MCP, JARVIS reads the project tree, edits scripts, runs a playtest and restarts your private server with one command.

17
00:01:06.070 --> 00:01:11.988
Ctrl+Alt+S — and it looks at the screen: a game, an error, code or an interface.

18
00:01:11.988 --> 00:01:17.019
Ctrl+Alt+T — and the translation lands right on top of the original.

19
00:01:18.319 --> 00:01:24.498
Weather, currency rates, notes, PC stats, Roblox status — all local plugins.

20
00:01:24.498 --> 00:01:26.531
Want your own superpower?

21
00:01:26.531 --> 00:01:30.027
Drop a Python file into the plugins folder.

22
00:01:30.027 --> 00:01:31.572
JARVIS picks it up.

23
00:01:32.872 --> 00:01:38.112
Keys, chat history and memory are stored only on your disk.

24
00:01:38.112 --> 00:01:39.622
No JARVIS server.

25
00:01:39.622 --> 00:01:43.530
You decide which provider gets your request.

26
00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:46.793
Windows, macOS or Linux.

27
00:01:46.793 --> 00:01:51.046
One button on the site — and the assistant is yours.

28
00:01:51.046 --> 00:01:54.153
No installer, account or subscription.

29
00:01:55.703 --> 00:01:56.694
JARVIS.

30
00:01:56.694 --> 00:01:58.921
Your computer is listening.

31
00:01:58.921 --> 00:02:01.067
Download it from the site.
